index afa6198c..4e3c80f1 100644
--- a/docs/j604.md
+++ b/docs/j604.md
@@ -63,3 +63,31 @@ such a rail to the OS (no SMC write, no DART bypass) after checking in the
 ADT that every pKW4 function of that line is a plain output of the SMC PMU;
 it still prepares only the qualified gP13 radio action, and refuses any rail
